  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwy-NJtF8XTNzchtgrW7TuMcZbcl0yCOF5XMdgTaAciQrz069v7FnRC-RHtNoIWwWRm/exec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwy-NJtF8XTNzchtgrW7TuMcZbcl0yCOF5XMdgTaAciQrz069v7FnRC-RHtNoIWwWRm/exec</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"티맵 다중 길찾기+경로상 최저가 주유소 경유 검색\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwy-NJtF8XTNzchtgrW7TuMcZbcl0yCOF5XMdgTaAciQrz069v7FnRC-RHtNoIWwWRm/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwy-NJtF8XTNzchtgrW7TuMcZbcl0yCOF5XMdgTaAciQrz069v7FnRC-RHtNoIWwWRm/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwy-NJtF8XTNzchtgrW7TuMcZbcl0yCOF5XMdgTaAciQrz069v7FnRC-RHtNoIWwWRm/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwy-NJtF8XTNzchtgrW7TuMcZbcl0yCOF5XMdgTaAciQrz069v7FnRC-RHtNoIWwWRm/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">티맵 다중 길찾기+경로상 최저가 주유소 경유 검색</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">자동차 이동경로상 저렴한 주유소 20곳 찾아 경유지로 선택하면,</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">얼만큼 더 시간과 거리가 걸리는지 확인해주는 웹앱(구글앱스크립트)을 만들어 봅니다.<br></span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(T맵 API + Opinet API 활용)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bb437146c0dc3f5e3e52eb0240d5c220f4f44bd8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bb437146c0dc3f5e3e52eb0240d5c220f4f44bd8\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"256\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">사용방법</span></b><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76d82e875c41ec1196443e9dc4c03fb556e9de58\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76d82e875c41ec1196443e9dc4c03fb556e9de58\" data-origin-width=\"465\" data-origin-height=\"282\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">출발지와 목적지를 입력하고 확인 버튼을 누릅니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">출발지는 현위치를 하여도 되고 검색하여 확인 눌러도 됩니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">자동차 버튼을 누르면</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">자가용을 이용하여 이동 경로와 걸리는 시간이 나옵니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">----------------</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">테스트로</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">출발지는 서울시청</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">도착지를 속초시청으로 해보았습니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/233bb71547a59fe1054f65762dcf2aa9e9f44d5a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/233bb71547a59fe1054f65762dcf2aa9e9f44d5a\" data-origin-width=\"439\" data-origin-height=\"251\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">자동차를 눌러봅니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aca805f9c36fcf398c61b4a34f46de62cfe8e96b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aca805f9c36fcf398c61b4a34f46de62cfe8e96b\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"269\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9314a53ec9599e89037d0f553fbf20fe792fc3e7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9314a53ec9599e89037d0f553fbf20fe792fc3e7\" data-origin-width=\"449\" data-origin-height=\"443\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">속초시청까지 이동시간, 이동거리 및 이동경로가 나옵니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">그리고 경로상 주유소 찾기 메뉴가 그 아래 나옵니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">경로 반경 1km,3km,5km 선택할 수 있으며, </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">휘발유, 경유 선택할 수 있습니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1km, 휘발유로 선택하고</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">경로상 주유소 최저가 검색 버튼을 눌러봅니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#8203;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cffaf7aa014f41f570a9257993b20a138a686c9e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cffaf7aa014f41f570a9257993b20a138a686c9e\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"259\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">경로상 1km내의 주유소 중 저렴한 20개의 주유소가 나옵니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">해보니</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">가장 저렴한 곳이 </span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d971ac00190f45a76f8032cfb5a2655f184dd221\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d971ac00190f45a76f8032cfb5a2655f184dd221\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"341\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">속초 가는 길 </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">양양에 있는 주유소입니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">완전 가는 길에 붙어 있는 주유소여서,</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">거리는 추가가 안되고 <br>시간은 1분이 줄었음(?) <br>실시간이여서 시간이 단축됨을<br>확인 할 수 있습니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">여행가기전, 출장가기전</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">이거 해보고 출발하면 좋을 것 같다는<br>생각을 해봅니다</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}